<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/peoples-republic-of-china"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/People's%20Republic%20of%20China.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>People's Republic of China</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Chinese People’s Volunteers enter the Korean War</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/united-state-of-rajasthan"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/United%20State%20of%20Rajasthan.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>United State of Rajasthan</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Sirohi joins and the union becomes the state of Rajasthan (26 January)</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-india"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20India.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of India</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The constitution comes into force and India becomes a republic on 26 January</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/hinduism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Hinduism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Hinduism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The constitution of the Republic of India abolishes untouchability</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/language/sanskrit"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Sanskrit.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Sanskrit</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">India’s constitution lists Sanskrit among the languages of the nation</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/government/federation"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Federation.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Federation</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">India’s constitution comes into force, making the country a “Union of States”</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/government/parliamentary-democracy"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Parliamentary%20democracy.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Parliamentary democracy</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">India’s constitution makes it a parliamentary republic on the Westminster model</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/socialist-federal-republic-of-yugoslavia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Socialist%20Federal%20Republic%20of%20Yugoslavia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Socialist Federal Republic of Yugoslavia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Workers' self-management is introduced: workers' councils manage enterprises and share their profits.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/bon"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Bon.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Bon</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">China invades Tibet, where there are about 300 Bon monasteries; Bonpo scholars begin to reach Europe and North America</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/non-aligned-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Non-Aligned%20Movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Non-Aligned Movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">India and Yugoslavia first use the term non-alignment at the United Nations, refusing to take sides in the Korean War</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/code-of-hammurabi"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Code%20of%20Hammurabi.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Code of Hammurabi</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Benno Landsberger begins the line of criticism that most judges paid the Code no attention, against the view that it was enforced law</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/chamorro-people"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Chamorro%20people.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Chamorro people</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Guam Organic Act made Guam an organised territory and its people US citizens</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/mary-mother-of-jesus"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mary%2C%20mother%20of%20Jesus.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mary, mother of Jesus</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Pope Pius XII defines the Assumption in Munificentissimus Deus</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/cusco"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Cusco.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Cusco</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">An earthquake on 21 May damages more than a third of the city's structures</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/seoul"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Seoul.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Seoul</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Korean War begins and Seoul changes hands four times</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/benin-bronzes"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Benin%20Bronzes.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Benin Bronzes</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The British Museum began to sell more than 30 Benin Bronzes to the Nigerian government, sales that stopped in 1972</span></li></ul></section>
